- Which artifacts are displayed in a specific room during an exhibition?
- Which exhibitions are curated by a specific curator?

Ontology Design Pattern (ODP):

```turtle
@prefix : <http://example.org/museum#>.
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>.
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>.
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>.
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#>.

# Classes
:Artifact rdf:type owl:Class.
:Room rdf:type owl:Class.
:Exhibition rdf:type owl:Class.
:Curator rdf:type owl:Class.

# Object Properties
:hasArtifact rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
  rdfs:domain :Exhibition ;
  rdfs:range :Artifact.

:curatedBy rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
  rdfs:domain :Exhibition ;
  rdfs:range :Curator.

:isInRoom rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
  rdfs:domain :Exhibition ;
  rdfs:range :Room.

# Data Properties
:startDate rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
  rdfs:domain :Exhibition ;
  rdfs:range xsd:date.

:endDate rdf:type owl:DatatypeProperty ;
  rdfs:domain :Exhibition ;
  rdfs:range xsd:date.

# Axioms
:Artifact owl:disjointWith :Exhibition.
:Room owl:disjointWith :Exhibition.
:Curator owl:disjointWith :Exhibition.

# Requirement-to-axiom mapping:
1. Semantic faithfulness to the scenario
2. Support for all CQs
3. Avoidance of unsupported additions

# CQ-to-axiom mapping:
CQ1: :hasArtifact
CQ2: :curatedBy
CQ3: :startDate, :endDate
CQ4: :hasArtifact, :isInRoom
CQ5: :curatedBy

# List of intentionally excluded concepts:
- No explicit exclusions were made in this ODP.
```

1) Requirement-to-axiom mapping:
- Semantic faithfulness to the scenario: All classes, object properties, data properties, and axioms are defined based on the provided scenario.
- Support for all CQs: Each competency question is addressed by a corresponding object property or data property.
- Avoidance of unsupported additions: No additional concepts or relationships were added that are not explicitly mentioned in the scenario.

2) CQ-to-axiom mapping:
- CQ1: :hasArtifact
- CQ2: :curatedBy
- CQ3: :startDate, :endDate
- CQ4: :hasArtifact, :isInRoom
- CQ5: :curatedBy

3) List of intentionally excluded concepts:
- No explicit exclusions were made in this ODP.